# {{SLUG}} — app scaffold

This frontend was scaffolded by MC (`scripts/scaffold/app.js`) with a real,
accessible component library so the product starts from a design system instead
of from raw HTML.

## Run

```bash
npm install          # one-time (the scaffold ships pinned deps, not node_modules)
npm run dev          # http://localhost:3000
npm run build        # production build
npm test             # Playwright e2e (desktop + mobile)
```

## Structure

```
src/
  app/        layout.tsx · page.tsx · not-found.tsx · globals.css (design tokens)
  components/
    ui/       button · card · input · label · dialog  (shadcn/ui + Radix)
  lib/
    utils.ts  cn() — the single class-merge seam
components.json   shadcn config (so `npx shadcn add <x>` lands in ui/)
next.config.ts    security headers baseline
```

See **DESIGN_SYSTEM.md** for the token model, how to extend the library, and the
S0.2 contract linkage (`design_brief` / `build_spec`).
